{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e4052950-151f-8732-81a4-41563a133705",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T11:06:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:03:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I'd like to report road damage. The edge of the pavement is crumbling at a curve near my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. Where is the curve?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have it written down here. It's at 7 Admiral Kalbfus Road, in the North End. The curve is right in front of the house, just before the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seven Admiral Kalbfus Road. Got it. And you said the edge of the road is crumbling. Is it the pavement breaking off along the side, or is it a hole in the travel lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the edge. The asphalt is breaking away along the outside of the curve, and there's a section about three feet long where it's come apart and left a drop-off. Pieces of it are out on the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, so crumbling edge with a drop-off, outside of the curve. Has any vehicle been affected by it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:04:50-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My neighbor hit it. He told me yesterday that his tire dropped right off the edge when he came around the bend. He said it jolted the whole car. I haven't hit it myself, but I'd rather it be fixed before somebody does damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that a neighbor's vehicle went over it. Do you know if he has a report in with us, or should I just put it under yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think he's called. Put it under mine, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:05:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:05:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Isabel Pacheco. P-A-C-H-E-C-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:05:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Isabel Pacheco. And a callback number, in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:05:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0166. Let me read it back. Isabel Pacheco, 7 Admiral Kalbfus Road, crumbling pavement edge at the curve, drop-off about three feet long, a neighbor's tire went off it. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Sorry, one moment. My brother-in-law is in the garage working on a motorcycle and he just started the engine. [pause] There, he's stopped. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:05:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'll get this to the road crew supervisor today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:06:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Can I ask how long repairs like this usually take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the backlog. Edge repairs and patching can be a few days to a couple of weeks, and in winter it can run longer, because the patch material doesn't set well in the cold. Sometimes they put down a temporary fill first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:06:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. A few days to a couple of weeks, maybe longer with the cold. I'll write that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. If it gets worse before then, or something happens there, call us back and we'll add it to the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:06:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Pacheco. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
